        "raw": "<p>(I know I&#39;m supposed to submit bugs through the app, but I wanted to post the situation here to make sure it&#39;s a bug before I waste the good folks at Handelabra&#39;s time)</p><p>Grandpa Legacy, Mr. Fixer, Argent Adept, Unity, and Dark Visionary vs. The Ennead in the Tomb of Anubis. &nbsp;Heroic Interception is in play.</p><p>Mr. Fixer has Jack Handle and Alternating Tiger Claw in play. &nbsp;An ankh card is played and Osiris forces each hero to deal themself 1 Psychic damage. &nbsp;Legacy does, then the other four heroes should be immune, right? &nbsp;When Mr. Fixer attempts to deal himself 1 Psychic damage, Jack Handle kicks in and he instead deals 2 Irreducible damage to each non-Hero target. &nbsp;(Two damage because he has Twist the Ether on him, if that matters.)</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">If I was playing this myself, I would assume that Mr. Fixer would not deal damage to himself due to Heroic Interception and thus Jack Handle would not kick in. &nbsp;Is this a bug that I should submit or am I just playing it wrong at home?&nbsp;</span></p>",
