        "created_at": "2015-07-10T17:07:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Fireside Chats\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n Fireside Chats:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p><span>Jack Handle effectively cancels the original damage, and causes a new set of damage dealing instance to all non-hero targets with the original damage amount/type/irreducibility.</span></p>\n<span>\n</span></blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p><span>Essentially, Jack handle doesn't care what is going to happen. Whenever Fixer would attack, that attack is completely canceled and a new attack hitting all non-hero targets is initiated.</span></p>",
